        },
        {
          "text": "Nundũ, sisyai, mũthenya nĩwũkĩte, wakanĩte ta iko ĩnene; na ekathĩĩi onthe, na onthe ala mekaa ũthũku, makeethĩwa ũa; na mũthenya ũla wũkĩte ũkamavĩvya vyũ, mũvaka ndũkamatialya mũi o na ũvonge, easya ũu Yeova wa nguthu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
